<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>英语-VICE</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 03:12:03 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>本森·布恩 (Benson Boone) 表示，粉丝在浴室里发现了他极其尴尬的时刻</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/benson-boone-says-fan-caught-him-in-extremely-awkward-bathroom-moment/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;本森·布恩 (Benson Boone) 透露，有一次，当他在小便池前大吃一惊时，一名粉丝走进了浴室。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/benson-boone-says-fan-caught-him-in-extremely-awkward-bathroom-moment/"&gt;本森·布恩 (Benson Boone) 称粉丝在浴室里极其尴尬的时刻抓住了他，&lt;/a&gt;该帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 23:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/benson-boone-says-fan-caught-him-in-extremely-awkward-bathroom-moment/</guid></item><item><title>两位第二代韩国流行音乐偶像在音乐录影带中相恋后确认正在约会</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/two-second-gen-k-pop-icons-confirm-theyre-dating-after-falling-for-each-other-on-a-music-video-set/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;BigBang 的标志性韩国流行歌手 TOP 和 After School 的 Nana 的代表已确认他们正在约会。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/two-second-gen-k-pop-icons-confirm-theyre-dating-after-falling-for-each-other-on-a-music-video-set/"&gt;两位第二代韩国流行音乐偶像在音乐录影带中相爱后确认正在约会，&lt;/a&gt;该帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 22:42:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/two-second-gen-k-pop-icons-confirm-theyre-dating-after-falling-for-each-other-on-a-music-video-set/</guid></item><item><title>那次阿姆鄙视了另一位说唱歌手，几乎立刻就后悔了：“这可能太远了”</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/that-time-eminem-dissed-another-rapper-and-almost-immediately-regretted-it-this-might-be-too-far/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;阿姆曾经嘲笑当今嘻哈界最伟大的说唱歌手之一，但几乎立即就后悔了他的做法。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/that-time-eminem-dissed-another-rapper-and-almost-immediately-regretted-it-this-might-be-too-far/"&gt;《那次埃米纳姆鄙视另一位说唱歌手并几乎立即后悔：“这可能太远了”的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 19:25:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/that-time-eminem-dissed-another-rapper-and-almost-immediately-regretted-it-this-might-be-too-far/</guid></item><item><title>武当派在余震节期间向老肮脏混蛋致以衷心敬意</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/wu-tang-clan-pay-heartfelt-tribute-to-ol-dirty-bastard-during-aftershock-festival-set/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在萨克拉门托的余震节上，武当派向已故的团体成员“肮脏混蛋”表达了温馨的敬意。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/wu-tang-clan-pay-heartfelt-tribute-to-ol-dirty-bastard-during-aftershock-festival-set/"&gt;武当派在余震节期间向老混蛋致以衷心的敬意&lt;/a&gt;后，首先在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上出现。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 17:47:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/wu-tang-clan-pay-heartfelt-tribute-to-ol-dirty-bastard-during-aftershock-festival-set/</guid></item><item><title>观看：萨克拉门托人群在余震节期间唱起 Limp Bizkit 经典歌曲的每一个字</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/watch-sacramento-crowd-sings-every-word-of-limp-bizkit-classic-during-aftershock-festival/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Limp Bizkit 在萨克拉门托的余震音乐节上疯狂地控制了人群，数百名歌迷尖叫着他们的热门歌曲“My Generation”。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;帖子《 &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/watch-sacramento-crowd-sings-every-word-of-limp-bizkit-classic-during-aftershock-festival/"&gt;观看：萨克拉门托人群在余震节期间唱起 Limp Bizkit 经典的每一个字》&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 16:33:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/watch-sacramento-crowd-sings-every-word-of-limp-bizkit-classic-during-aftershock-festival/</guid></item><item><title>新游戏片段中揭示了 FF7 Revelation 温泉功能</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/ff7-revelation-hot-springs-feature-revealed-in-new-gameplay-footage/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Square Enix 在 FF7 Revelation 中透露了一项温泉功能，可以让克劳德与队友一起洗澡。 《最终幻想 7》导演滨口直树展示了新机制，并据报道确认浴室将是男女混合的。 《FF7启示录》温泉功能让与党员一起云浴《FF7启示录》将推出[…]&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/ff7-revelation-hot-springs-feature-revealed-in-new-gameplay-footage/"&gt;《FF7 启示录》后的温泉功能在新游戏片段中&lt;/a&gt;首次出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 16:29:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/ff7-revelation-hot-springs-feature-revealed-in-new-gameplay-footage/</guid></item><item><title>日本童星不幸去世 年仅八岁</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/japanese-child-star-tragically-passes-away-at-only-eight-years-old/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;DIANNA Project 的日本童星平田露娜 (Hirata Luna) 因流感引起的心脏并发症去世，享年 8 岁。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/japanese-child-star-tragically-passes-away-at-only-eight-years-old/"&gt;日本童星年仅八岁就不幸去世的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/japanese-child-star-tragically-passes-away-at-only-eight-years-old/</guid></item><item><title>戴夫·格罗尔 (Dave Grohl) 与有史以来最伟大的摇滚乐队之一一起表演了一生难忘的演出</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/dave-grohl-performs-the-gig-of-a-lifetime-with-one-of-the-greatest-rock-bands-of-all-time/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;戴夫·格罗尔 (Dave Grohl) 在大都会人寿体育场 (MetLife Stadium) 与 AC/DC 合作演唱了他们的标志性歌曲《通往地狱的高速公路》(Highway To Hell)，这是他一生中最难忘的演出。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/dave-grohl-performs-the-gig-of-a-lifetime-with-one-of-the-greatest-rock-bands-of-all-time/"&gt;戴夫·格罗尔 (Dave Grohl) 与有史以来最